sy nature makes her do more than she says. In a sense, the type that shows in action. Although she is somewhat familiar with her etiquette, she considers herself to be a warrior, so she is a weak person, and feels resistance to her behavior as a princess."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For generations, she is the daughter of a royal family who has served as a knight in the Vatican. She suspects that Gatria is behind the scenes and is at war with her neighbor."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49747"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ノーレン国の姫将軍。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"色白、金色長髪、吊り目、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"凛とした表情、ナイスバディ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気位が高く、とてもクール、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から男の子のように育てられ、老いた父親に代わって"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"異教徒討伐の戦場に赴くことが多かった為、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"軍隊の中での象徴的な存在となり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"国民的英雄として人気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強気だが、無口で不器用な性格のため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言うよりも行いのほうが先になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある意味、行動で示すタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"礼儀作法は一応知ってはいるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分は武人であると思っているため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"軟弱な物として姫としてのたしなみ、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"行いに抵抗を感じている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"代々、法王庁の騎士を務めてきた王家の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ガトリア国が裏で糸をひき、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"隣国との戦争になっていると疑っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13172","sourceWorkId":"12737","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a4eff4a50e52c2db4e0f8a226795f75a12cfa0c575319f33ff22454423af2482.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c259b76aa2d01908e5ab64c438a49d08179165e7f070cfe956025633aa68ef3.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"このは","creatorId":"vndb:s280","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s280","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s280","name":"藤森 ゆき奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21609","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c49749","characterName":"アイリス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["13173"],"vndbCharacterId":"c49749"},"originalCharacterName":"アイリス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Prince Marion's younger sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the princess of the Lunaburg family of the neighboring Kingdom of Caldonia. She is a princess with pink hair and a big ribbon."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has an unrivaled love for cute things, and her hobby is decorating her maid Cyan."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In fact, she has a brother-sister relationship with Prince Marion, and she was sent to Caldonia when she was a child."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She calls Marion her \"older brother\" and she still admires him to this day."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is smart, serious, single-minded and has a very strong will. She has a kind heart and genuinely cares about others as if she were her own. She wishes for the happiness of people regardless of her status."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49749"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"マリオン王子の妹姫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"隣国カルドニア王国のルナブルク家の姫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ピンク髪、大きなリボンが特徴的なお姫様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無類の可愛いもの好きで、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メイドのシアンを飾り立てるのが趣味。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実はマリオン王子とは兄妹の間柄で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼少期にカルドニアに養女に出された境遇。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マリオンのことを「お兄様」と呼び今でも慕っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聡明で、真面目で、一途で、意志力がとても強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他人のことをわが身のように"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真剣に心配してくれる優しい心根の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身分の差などは関係なく人の幸せを願っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寄生生物ペニセダに寄生され"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フ○ナリの身体にされてしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13173","sourceWorkId":"12737","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9ddd22ba6f698b8620f5172cb0d12f79de91ae956872fbfd195246e8fe82ed1f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bd38ec98ea190bb445796c1fda043e58c5b54e538e57c94200ca499e7873673e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"草柳 順子","creatorId":"vndb:s631","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s631","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s631","name":"中田 順子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21612","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c49750","characterName":"ルシア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18540","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14623"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13174"],"vndbCharacterId":"c49750"},"originalCharacterName":"ルシア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"63"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"143cm"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"64"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A maid with Princess Stia."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a loli-loli appearance, and although she loves gossip and is a bit snobbish, she is a bright and steady worker."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is short in stature, and the way she wanders around with chocolate is very humorous and cute."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a manly man, and she's not afraid to use a stunned Stia."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She came from a poor peasant family, was abandoned by her parents and forced to do her hard labor, and was picked up by Stia on her travels. In order to repay her kindness, she is desperately sent to Stia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49750"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"スティア姫付きのメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ロリロリの風貌、噂好きで少々かしましい部分はあるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るくしっかりした働き者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長が低く、チョコチョコとうろつく様は"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とてもユーモラスで可愛らしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男勝りで憮然としたスティアに物怖じせず遣えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"貧乏な農民の出で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親に捨てられ過酷な労働を強いられていた彼女を、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外遊中のスティアが拾った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その恩を返すべく、彼女は必死でスティアに遣えている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13174","sourceWorkId":"12737","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"斯蒂娅公主的女仆。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"萝莉体型，喜欢八卦且有些多嘴，不过却是十分开朗且坚强的仆人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身高很矮，那副匆匆忙忙的样子非常讨人喜欢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对于一副不会输于男子氛围的斯蒂娅没有感到害怕。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"贫困的农民出身，斯蒂娅的父母捡到了被父母强迫进行繁重劳动最后被抛弃的她。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"为了报恩，任凭斯蒂娅使唤。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18540"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/24e79c096498b9fc6858689e8554121ba194b3ae1e1b151879aa529b4bfa40c2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c174522b3ca7c98f47f8f18e5448c10668971e00626838b4cf9d526ea9f5511.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平山ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s285","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s285","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s285","name":"東かりん","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:14623:18540:5905:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c49753","characterName":"シアン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["13175"],"vndbCharacterId":"c49753"},"originalCharacterName":"シアン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Maid with Princess Iris."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a newly appointed maid who was personally accompanied by the king as a condition for attending Iris's garden party."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is Iris's hobby, and her maid outfit is cute and decorated, but she has a taciturn, cold expression, is always calm, and lacks emotional ups and downs. She is quick-witted but inflexible."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She claims to have no sense of direction, and she often wanders around the castle, but the extent to which she really is unknown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious maid that even Iris doesn't know what kind of past she has."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49753"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アイリス姫付きメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回のアイリスの園遊会出席に際し、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"条件として国王が直々に随行させた新任のメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アイリスの趣味で、メイド服は可愛らしく飾り立てられているが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で冷たい表情、常に冷静で、感情の起伏が乏しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"機転は利くが融通は利かない等、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いろいろツッコミ所満載なメイドである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自称方向音痴で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よく城内を迷ってウロウロとしているが、真相の程は不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どのような過去をもつのかアイリスも知らない、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なにかと謎の多いメイド。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13175","sourceWorkId":"12737","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0538cf3a77a8e171827de3ad06676d17de1a65e322ad0549bbd978b34d46679.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/93d0f73a764d2e50d576fa88540e82b41bfdd8f8826392458f2e003751025832.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"credited